title: 'sc-rpc: Mark `state_getKeys` and `childstate_getKeys` as unsafe'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |
    `state_getKeys` and `childstate_getKeys` are now treated as unsafe RPC methods, in line
    with `state_getPairs`. When the node runs with `--rpc-methods=safe`, external callers
    are no longer allowed to use them. Both methods are deprecated; use the paginated
    `state_getKeysPaged` and `childstate_getKeysPaged` instead.
crates:
- name: sc-rpc-api
  bump: major
- name: sc-rpc
  bump: major
